                                        <android.widget.TextView index="1" package="sg.gov.ica.mobile.app" class="android.widget.TextView" text="The mobile app intermittently freezes/crashes. What can I do to resolve this issue?" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" scrollable="false" selected="false" bounds="[84,544][1356,807]" displayed="true" a11y-important="true" screen-reader-focusable="false" drawing-order="2" showing-hint="false" text-entry-key="false" dismissable="false" a11y-focused="false" heading="false" live-region="0" context-clickable="false" content-invalid="false" window-id="164" />
                                        <android.widget.TextView index="2" package="sg.gov.ica.mobile.app" class="android.widget.TextView" text='Here are some possible ways to rectify the issue:&#10;&#10;1. Restart your device. This process will free up memory to access the mobile app.&#10;&#10;   a. On Android: Tap "Restart" or "Power Off". The latter requires you to press the Power button again after a few seconds.&#10;&#10;   b. On iOS: Slide to power off (from left to right). Wait a few seconds, and press the Power button to start your device.&#10;&#10;2. Update the mobile app. Ensure that you have the latest version of our mobile app by going to the Google Play (Android) or App Store (iOS).&#10;&#10;3. Check internet/mobile data connection. Ensure that you have good internet/mobile connection as poor connection can force the mobile app to freeze or crash.&#10;&#10;4. Clear cache and data.&#10;&#10;5. Free up disk space in your device.&#10;&#10;6. Reinstall the mobile app.' checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" scrollable="false" selected="false" bounds="[84,807][1356,2482]" displayed="true" a11y-important="true" screen-reader-focusable="false" drawing-order="3" showing-hint="false" text-entry-key="false" dismissable="false" a11y-focused="false" heading="false" live-region="0" context-clickable="false" content-invalid="false" window-id="164" />
